WEBVTT

00:08:59.954 --> 00:09:01.871
They want to dominate the others.

00:09:02.454 --> 00:09:05.787
And of course, that's what we see
in some politicians. Right.

00:09:06.204 --> 00:09:11.246
We effect when I see two chimpanzee males
bristling, swaggering, upright,

00:09:11.829 --> 00:09:16.329
furious scowl on their face using
intimidation tactics because it's

00:09:16.329 --> 00:09:20.537
a waste of time to fight, you might get
hurt. So mostly it's intimidation.

00:09:20.996 --> 00:09:26.079
And it reminds me just exactly of some
human male politicians. They do the same.

00:09:27.621 --> 00:09:30.954
It's so true. Why do you say
human male politicians?